edge0_vllm/csrc (EDGE0_CPU_EXPERTS, docs/CPU-EXPERTS.md)

The CPU expert pool and the GPU <-> CPU hand-off follow the design of Strata's CPU expert pool (edge0-strata:
src/kernels/cpu/pool.cpp; src/kernels/cuda/elementwise.cu doorbell_ring_kernel / doorbell_wait_kernel;
s2_expert_grouped.cu add_hits_mapped_kernel), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Niko1221 and the Strata contributors:
pinned busy-polling workers, a doorbell sequence number incremented from memory inside CUDA graphs, a spin wait on a
host-raised flag with a timeout. No Strata source file is copied. The AVX-512 kernels read vLLM's Marlin NVFP4 layout
and reproduce its epilogue roundings (vLLM, Apache-2.0: csrc/quantization/marlin/gptq_marlin_repack.cu,
csrc/moe/marlin_moe_wna16/marlin_template.h, csrc/activation_kernels.cu). The expf polynomial is Cephes' (public
domain).

